      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The 10Mb limit was made for the original Quest, now that we have Quest 2 and Quest 3 the limit really needs to be increased.\n\nThis limit is always the one that prevents porting an avatar from PC to Quest, other issues can be worked around, but not this one.\n\nEspecially now that the SDK requires setting ASTC compression as the default to allow uploading, which drastically increases the file size, everyone has to manually override it back to Crunched to get below the limit, if you even can.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "64b6b861a803ed0da98c940c",
      "author": {
        "_id": "633050fb7dea1644bb2cc697",
        "alias": "Innocent Cattle",
        "aliasID": "65c294b8ed6eefce4c685eb8",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny-assets.io/images/07342c5e4debcf8094cb21e0bef4b228.png",
        "created": "2022-09-25T13:00:43.292Z",
        "name": "rkxspace",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": null
      },
      "authorID": null,
      "boardID": "5ed571497ee72a2434704a15",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
